  "definition": "Obligations and Responsibilities of Microblading Certificate Holders",
  "effectiveDate": "2026-09-21",
  "expirationDate": "2036-09-21",
  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 600) #13337, eff 1-27-22; ss by #14631, eff 9-21-26, EXPIRES: 9-21-36 (formerly Plc 605.07)",
